    "notes": "No audio, no amounts on screen (only ingredient names): all quantities are guesses from the jar. The dals and oats go in dry (not soaked) in the video; a weak mixie may need a few hours of soaking. The white pieces labelled 'ginger' look like garlic cloves on screen. Cooking steps (oil, crisp, fold) are shown at the start of the clip and reordered here. Chutney and podi are shown but not made."
